 "short_name": "Makana",
 "_doc": "Makana LM (Makhanda) emunsoft 'TAX INVOICE / STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT' (same system as Lekwa). METER READINGS table (water, KVA and three TIME OF USE registers per meter; register-to-band order not labelled, so start/end readings are left blank), ACCOUNT DETAILS ledger with units@tariff and VALUE ex VAT, one whole-bill VAT line (009008) and INTEREST (009009). Electricity = codes 000487-000491: regular 'MV - TOU - PEAK/STANDARD/OFF PEAK' lines -> TOU kWh and Rands, 'MV - BULK TOU - DEMAND' -> kVA and demand Rands, everything else on those codes (demand basic charge, reactive energy, FINAL USAGE reversals and DN debit notes after the Nov-2025 meter change) -> other_r. Meter = the TOU meter(s) with an actual/interim reading. Fingerprint: own VAT number + name. IDENTITY x_elec_ex_id = TOTAL DUE - Opening Balance - all non-electricity lines incl. payments - VAT - interest: 0.00 on 10/10 (one of them an OCR'd scan). 10 bills checked; one bill bills two meters/periods (meter change) so its kWh and Rands are the sum of both.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "4330193873"
  ],
  "any": [
   "MAKANA LOCAL MUNICIPALITY"
  ],
  "reject_if_text": []
